{"scraped_at": "2026-06-04T07:26:16.694941+00:00", "run_id": "20260604_072616", "page": 147, "api_response": {"count": 3946, "per_page": 20, "current_page": 147, "total_pages": 198, "next": "https://tripadvisor-scraper-api.omkar.cloud/reviews?query=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FAttraction_Review-g293890-d310712-Reviews-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html&page=148&sort_by=most_recent&locale=en-US", "previous": "https://tripadvisor-scraper-api.omkar.cloud/reviews?query=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FAttraction_Review-g293890-d310712-Reviews-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html&page=146&sort_by=most_recent&locale=en-US", "results": [{"review_id": 239619158, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r239619158-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "A Deep Experience", "text": "I visit here on every visit. I sit opposite the great shrine and watch the ghats. I also birdwatch all around the area. History and culture superbly conbined. There are hawkers but the sell very nice bowls. Do not miss im this awesome place.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2013-12-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "814E7A5F128F9E0BEEB053E36BF01548", "name": "Kieran D", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/964kierand", "username": "964kierand", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/f0/48/default-avatar-2020-15.jpg", "contribution_count": 36, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 1060912, "location_name": "Kokubunji", "location_name_detailed": "Kokubunji, Japan"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/06/e4/bc/12/a-view-of-the-main-temple.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2014-11-13", "published_at_date": "2014-11-13"}, {"review_id": 239585303, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r239585303-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "An absolute must-visit!", "text": "This Hindu temple complex is something not to be missed. Includes a cremation area, which is truly a profound and humbling experience. It is rare that non-Hindus are allowed to witness such a solemn spectacle. \n\nThe sadhus, holy men painted in white clay and colorful markings, are a sight to see! They also have a sense of humor. But, please know that they expect to be tipped and depend on that for their survival. \n\nBe prepared to be accosted continually by people trying to sell you their wares. Be respectful and firmly say no if you are not interested, sometimes repeatedly. Again, they are only trying to feed their families. \n\n", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "business", "stay_date": "2014-11-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "C077040579EEF9EF2D6BB8C103F583DD", "name": "Lester P", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/LesPicker", "username": "LesPicker", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-s/01/b9/59/bc/lespicker.jpg", "contribution_count": 468, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 41187, "location_name": "Havre de Grace", "location_name_detailed": "Havre de Grace, Maryland"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2014-11-12", "published_at_date": "2014-11-12"}, {"review_id": 239435260, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r239435260-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Very interesting to see the ceremony", "text": "A beautiful tempel complex by the river, where on average 50 bodies a  day get cremated according to hindu traditions. We had a good guide who told us Beautiful stories and we sat and watched the ceremony for a white. Only negative point was the hackers who followed us during our visit.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "family", "stay_date": "2014-11-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "02AFD139CA63A4F05A2877CE7202125D", "name": "Hetje1954", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Hetje1954", "username": "Hetje1954", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/06/e3/6f/bf/hetje1954.jpg", "contribution_count": 77, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 188631, "location_name": "Oudewater", "location_name_detailed": "Oudewater, The Netherlands"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2014-11-12", "published_at_date": "2014-11-11"}, {"review_id": 239263171, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r239263171-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "One of the Jyoti Lingams of Hinduism", "text": "A holy site of Hinduism, it was a good experience in spite of the crowding, especially when somebody from the security staff returned a bag with a substantial amount of cash we'd forgotten somewhere!", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "family", "stay_date": "2013-12-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "3344C49996D0DA763208F10C1A4F8E5A", "name": "Dheeraj Bharti", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/dheerajbharti", "username": "dheerajbharti", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/f4/5d/default-avatar-2020-32.jpg", "contribution_count": 33, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 679014, "location_name": "Secunderabad", "location_name_detailed": "Secunderabad, India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2014-11-11", "published_at_date": "2014-11-11"}, {"review_id": 239190099, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r239190099-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Death And Life", "text": "This visit both represented death and life. This is one of the holiest hindu temples that stretches across Nepal and India. This temple represents the head of the Hindu God. Only Hindus are allowed in to the temple. This does not mean that it is worth a skip. It is still very much a good place to visit. \n\nThe cremation ceremony behind the temple was just .... surreal. Be prepared for the smell of burning flesh and ashes. Bring a facemask or cloth to cover the face. \n\nThe motorikes near that area were all very chaotic. So be careful when you cross the road.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "friends", "stay_date": "2014-03-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "F36AB693A9383E65125A642DDD266E8E", "name": "TheNoobTraveller", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/TheNoobTraveller", "username": "TheNoobTraveller", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/f3/e4/default-avatar-2020-30.jpg", "contribution_count": 28, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 298570, "location_name": "Kuala Lumpur", "location_name_detailed": "Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2014-11-11", "published_at_date": "2014-11-10"}, {"review_id": 239129271, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r239129271-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "The most important place for Hindus", "text": "An important place for Hindus and the stench of burning bodies always hang in the air. Non Hindus are not allowed inside the site but visitors can view the complex from the opposite bank of the river which is little better than a filthy open sewer.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 2, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "solo", "stay_date": "2013-12-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "C5B7B4CC97F02E86F6CF0E7C2E220751", "name": "rodneycs", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/rodneycs", "username": "rodneycs", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/08/bf/9d/08/rodneycs.jpg", "contribution_count": 343, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 190428, "location_name": "Linz", "location_name_detailed": "Linz, Austria"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2014-11-10", "published_at_date": "2014-11-10"}, {"review_id": 239096638, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r239096638-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Just go see", "text": "There were so many so called guides around who will try to get you to enggage their services. The entrance fee was 1000 Nepalesse rupees. The giude fee was expensive and we just left the place.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 3, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "friends", "stay_date": "2014-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "2F65F7E4DDE7D70A7E4129D7071F854D", "name": "GunaseelanT", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/GunaseelanT", "username": "GunaseelanT", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/05/05/66/d9/gunaseelant.jpg", "contribution_count": 22, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 294265, "location_name": "Singapore", "location_name_detailed": "Singapore, Singapore"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2014-11-10", "published_at_date": "2014-11-10"}, {"review_id": 239021092, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r239021092-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Worth a visit if you don't mind seeing the dead", "text": "Is one of the holiest temple but for cremation of the dead in the open air. Is a whole ritual where the dead will be wash in the river, pray and then burn while their family uses the river water to wash their own head and feet. They believe is the holy water. Lots of monkey around and if you walk up the stairs to the top you will have a nice view.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "friends", "stay_date": "2014-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "40C2A610C4B7C157908C5ADED7508D63", "name": "Annie Gan", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Anniegmy", "username": "Anniegmy", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/05/ed/ba/b2/anniegmy.jpg", "contribution_count": 366, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 298570, "location_name": "Kuala Lumpur", "location_name_detailed": "Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/06/e0/4e/65/pashupatinath-temple.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/06/e0/4e/6c/pashupatinath-temple.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2014-11-10", "published_at_date": "2014-11-09"}, {"review_id": 239020588, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r239020588-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Get a guide and it will be worth every rupee", "text": "The temple complex itself is not very big but there are so many stories in each post and pillar that you must take a guide along. He will tell you that each door to the \"garbhgreh\" is different and how, he will tell you the stories about the idols and places, he will guide you to ticket counters and storage room for your cameras and other stuff (photography is prohibited inside the temple complex)......and he might even add some folk lore and tips of other places to visit!", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "family", "stay_date": "2014-09-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "0B69816E1746187E4A3969AB40EBB748", "name": "deshanupam", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/deshanupam", "username": "deshanupam", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/07/0b/c5/d0/deshanupam.jpg", "contribution_count": 85, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 297654, "location_name": "Pune", "location_name_detailed": "Pune, India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2014-11-10", "published_at_date": "2014-11-09"}, {"review_id": 238957563, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r238957563-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "A very dignified place", "text": "One of Hindu's most sacred sites on the banks of the river Bagmati and a place of pilgrimage for Hindus. As non Hindus, we were not allowed to enter the main temple, and we fully understood this, but the surrounding area is fascinating. \n\nThe human cremations on the ghats seem very strange to westerners. They are public cremations and no one minds if you watch and take photos, though we did not venture onto the cremation side of the river. Some did and it looked and felt intrusive, though locals didn't seem to bother at all. The cremation ceremonies seemed very solemn and dignified, unlike those in Varanasi that felt grubby.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2014-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "1A10AECD45E241D7CF20014D26A91954", "name": "NeilandBarbara", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/NeilandBarbara", "username": "NeilandBarbara", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/04/8f/80/85/neilandbarbara.jpg", "contribution_count": 3400, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 1096784, "location_name": "Bromborough", "location_name_detailed": "Bromborough, United Kingdom"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2014-11-09", "published_at_date": "2014-11-09"}, {"review_id": 238901399, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r238901399-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Pashupatinathnath temple", "text": "Its very nice please to visit. Holy Hindu temple.\nIt was sad that we are not allowed to enter on main\ntample where only Hindu were aloud.....", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "friends", "stay_date": "2014-11-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "6D339A89720AF92A327C693CA249D598", "name": "99woo_c", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/99woo_c", "username": "99woo_c", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/ee/10/default-avatar-2020-8.jpg", "contribution_count": 2, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2014-11-09", "published_at_date": "2014-11-09"}, {"revie